        "title": "A typical request path",
        "source": "flowchart LR\n  U[Users] --> DNS[DNS]\n  DNS --> CDN[CDN]\n  CDN --> LB[Load balancer]\n  LB --> GW[API gateway: auth and rate limits]\n  GW --> S1[Stateless service]\n  GW --> S2[Stateless service]\n  S1 --> CA[(Cache)]\n  S1 --> DB[(Database with replicas)]\n  S1 --> Q[Queue]\n  Q --> W[Workers]\n  W --> OS[(Object storage)]\n  W --> SE[(Search index)]",
